{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S07压缩了“以后遇到难事只能独自扛，自己是否撑得住、当初是否还会走”的关键心理因果；S13也弱化了“不再为了留住谁而吞下委屈”这一最终立场，X表达得更完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的【重点】让普通观众更容易迅速抓住每段叙事核心，感受又随音乐节点出现，不只是罗列情绪，而是能把声音变化、身体感受和心理活动联系起来。尤其在怀念、焦躁、短暂安宁、重新不安和最终向前的转换中，Y的细节更具体，音乐与人物经历也更像一条连续的线；但X在解释人物为什么犹豫、为什么最终不回头时，叙事因果更充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "720efd8e-f291-4af1-9008-c83a5ee029ec", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T153524854574Z", "elapsed_seconds": 41.281, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T15:36:06.151420+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6a977cb7e28d00360c47b0c805cf52256e863c2542d10ece25186b3b760a17a8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web